# Task Workflow

## Before starting

1. Read `docs/project/05-current-state.md` and the full current TASK file.
2. One TASK at a time.

## Lifecycle

| Stage | Command |
| ----- | ------- |
| Start | `vibeops task add` |
| Build | Cursor (no CLI) |
| Submit | `vibeops task ship TASK-NNN` |
| Follow-up | `vibeops task reship TASK-NNN` (Shipped only, after merge) |
| Integrate | `vibeops task merge TASK-NNN` (or host UI) |
| Cleanup | `vibeops task sync TASK-NNN` |

## Completion

- Fill **Result** and **Test Result** before `task ship` (or before `task reship` for follow-ups).
- After MR merge (before or after optional `task sync`), update `05-current-state.md` and logs if not already done.
- TASK **Status** stays **Shipped** after merge/sync — only `task add` sets **In Progress**.
